!! Proposed Definition of ''ve rai''

;__ve rai__ (BAI*):  superlative among Tags a sumti as fitting the 4th place of traji.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 4th place of traji and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is (set)                      -est; most extremely; superlative among .. the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also:
